                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-to-expect-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A dependable mobile truck repair provider arrives prepared. Technicians travel with diagnostic tools, commonly needed replacement parts, and the experience to troubleshoot quickly. A typical service call includes:",
                    "align": "left",
