                  "id": "p-confidence-on-road-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Breakdowns happen, even to well-maintained trucks. What matters is how quickly and professionally they're handled. Knowing when to call for semi truck road service, what to expect, and who to trust can turn a stressful situation into a manageable one. At Sun State International, we're committed to helping drivers stay safe, productive, and supported, whether that means parts, service, or guidance when you need it most.",
